# Icons

- Use `src/design/icons/Icon.tsx` for standard Lucide icons.
- Pass sizes and semantic theme colors; do not hardcode icon hex values in feature code (category tint from DB is OK when displaying that category).
- Add new glyphs to the closed `registry` in `Icon.tsx` — do not import Lucide ad hoc in features.
- Verify glyph names instead of guessing.
- Do not use raster images for inline UI icons.
- Put accessibility labels on meaningful icon controls; mark decorative icons appropriately.
